fa81dc95cb4a2c8f3481b326967caeacb6e901a3Alexander Bandukwala2026-08-21T13:49:00-04:002026-09-09T11:27:46-04:00Make equality explicit at the type in src/haz3lcore

Same pass as language and web: name the equality that Reason's == and !=
mean -- String.equal, Char.equal, Float.equal. 94 sites across 22 files
(81 string, 11 char, 1 float, plus one multi-line comparison in FastParse
