3af99f85b1b3e01b5251d9e6ea0b170d399ae5e5disconcision2026-09-07T22:06:00-07:002026-09-09T00:30:28-07:00Compositional statics: spine roots carry the whole-suffix elab_term

The incremental evaluator reuses a node's previous result when its
elab_term is unchanged. Under the per-item engine the program's spine
roots (each `let … in`) carried the HOLLOW item elab (body = hole), so
the top root read as unchanged whatever happened downstream: an edit to
any definition but the first was never re-evaluated until an upstream
item changed. fix_spine_infos now grafts the suffix onto each root's
elab_term (the same term whole_elab builds; untouched subtrees are
shared). Regression test in Test_ModRoot.

