73325cb58c59ace21f69dd9f366c9986116cf5b3disconcision2026-09-08T00:57:41-07:002026-09-09T00:30:11-07:00Canvas wells act on the master editor; selected sample outlined

A well's sample-focus and probe actions went to the ACTIVE editor,
which in constellation mode is the open definition cell, so ← → and
sample clicks never moved the master's sample focus (the wells display
the master's dynamics): arrow navigation did nothing in mode. Wells now
dispatch to the whole-program editor. The selected sample's outline
keyed on the probe's `.indicated` class, which wells never carry; give
wells their own inset outline (green; red while the well has focus).

