of_slide_text stripped all leading whitespace after every newline, a
leftover from the implicit level-map indentation model; indentation is
explicit here (Measured.of_segment_inner), so the strip flattened every
nested line of every documentation slide. Only line endings are
normalized now. TextRoundtrip (132) green.

