d7ba5475dc239065d993536578ec2a3cf31989e1disconcision2026-09-08T10:19:09-07:002026-09-09T00:30:03-07:00Compositional statics: a livelit definition edit dirties its uses

A use's co_ctx names its livelit "^name" (Statics' LivelitName case)
while the definition's export was named "name", so the dependency
never matched: editing a livelit definition re-analyzed only the
definition item, every use kept the old LivelitEntry in its ctx, and
the projectors rendered the stale view until an unrelated edit near a
use happened to dirty it. The export now carries the co_ctx spelling.
Test rewrites the literal in place (same ids, as the incremental parse
does) — a fresh parse would have hidden the bug.

