50e0b70afcb740aa1d1dcc2438782f89aec0e7dddisconcision2026-09-08T02:11:22-07:002026-09-08T02:11:22-07:00Keep the completion witness on any infix mold after dev's #2484

dev narrowed Piece.is_infix_delimiter_op_prefix to the backup
concave-grout molds so display stops painting real infix `=`/`-` as
pending delimiters. Completion's prefix witness wants the opposite
reading: the `=` left by deleting the `>` of `=>` remolds as real
infix equality, so the mold-identity test rejects exactly the case the
witness exists for. Inline the pre-merge condition there (any infix
mold + delimiter-prefix token); the other four consumers keep dev's
stricter predicate.

Fixes CanonicalCompletion: symbolic-witness "deleted > of =>".

