8b77398ea59f7e3233a88ed754700b4cc74a3e9cdisconcision2026-09-04T21:40:30-07:002026-09-04T21:40:30-07:00canvas: stable module colors, hulls grow with members, Trine pulls the arrow, drag-follow and pick-up

