- The avatar read "edit" whenever the agent was busy after any successful
  tool, for the rest of the run. Edit is now only around a landed edit (a
  score playing, or a tool result within 1.5 s); otherwise a busy agent
  thinks. The avatar-site branch took its state from busy alone; it takes
  the same rule. A replay's agent counts as busy. The player clears its
  mood 200 ms after each score.
- Thought bubble: yellow cloud, dark-brown outline and text.

