4da5dbf1804bdc45cc776aff7091055cb35864ccMatthew Hammer2026-09-04T16:16:04-06:002026-09-04T16:16:04-06:00Document the Fumola module library

Eleven modules are now bound at the top level of every Fumola instance --
Adapton, List, LazyList, PureList, LevelTree, HashMap, Counters, RandomInput,
MergeSort, Gcd and DelayedPut -- so Gcd.gcd(12, 18) works with no import, and
